<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ashworth rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ashworth rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dain Bosworth analyst Diane Daggatt said Tuesday she began coverage of Ashworth Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Ashworth designs and distributes sports appareal, headwear and shoes.</p>
<p>-- Ashworth shares were up 5/8 at 6-5/8.</p>
<p>-- She estimates fiscal 1997 earnings at $0.36 a share, up from $0.12 a year ago, and fiscal 1998 earnings at $0.55.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
